    <briefdescription>
<para>A convenience class that further groups segments based on memory deallocation policy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows clients to make two slab allocations: one for all standard segments, and one for all finalize segments. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
